      "[Q16 \u00b7 Technical \u00b7 1 Mark] [GATE 2026 CS1] Consider the following C statement:\nchar * str1 = \"Hello\"; // stmt S\nchar * str2 = \"Hello\"; // stmt S\nchar * str3 = \"Hello\" // stmt S\nWhich of the following are correct?",
