      "[Q20 \u00b7 Technical \u00b7 1 Mark] [GATE 2026 CS1] Consider the following single precision floating point numbers and the opera-\ntion.\nX : (35C00000)H\nY : (34A00000)H\nZ = X + Y\nWhat is the value of 'Z' in hexadecimal?",
