      "[Q1 \u00b7 GA \u00b7 1 Mark] [GATE 2026 CS2] Consider three machines M, N, and P with IP addresses 100.10.5.2, 100.10.5.5,\nand 100.10.5.6 respectively. The subnet mask is set to 255.255.255.252 for all the\nthree machines. Which one of the following is true?",
