      "[Q5 \u00b7 GA \u00b7 1 Mark] [GATE 2026 CS2] For\u03a3 ={a, b}, let us consider the regular languageL={x|x=a 2+3k orx=\nb10+12k, k\u22650}. Which one of the following can be a pumping length (the constant\nguaranteed by the pumping lemma) forL?",
