      "[Q7 \u00b7 GA \u00b7 2 Marks] [GATE 2026 CS2] ConsiderZ=X-Y, whereX,YandZare all in sign-magnitude form.Xand\nYare each represented innbits. To avoid overflow, the representation ofZwould\nrequire a minimum of:",
