      "[Q20 \u00b7 Technical \u00b7 1 Mark] [GATE 2026 CS2] Four 4 bit 2's-complement numbers are given:N 1 = 1011,N 2 = 1101,N 3 =\n1010,N 4 = 1001. Which of the following arithmetic operations results in overflow?",
