      "[Q9 \u00b7 GA \u00b7 2 Marks] [GATE 2023 CS] Two nodes A and B transmit packets across a 10 km fiber optic cable at speed 2 * 10^8 m/s. Node A transmits at 1 Gbps. What packet size makes transmission delay EQUAL to propagation delay?",
